<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/34/eng@/~cl_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of \"foreign company\" the following definition: ' \"foreign institution\" means a foreign company which carries on business outside Malaysia which is similar to the Islamic banking business as provided under this Act or the business of any institution licensed under subsection 6(4) of the Banking and Financial Institutions Act 1989 [Act 372];';"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/34/eng@> .
