<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/34/eng@/~cl_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting before the definition of \"Islamic bank\" the following definition: ' \"international Islamic bank\" means any company or an office of any foreign institution which carries on international Islamic banking business and holds a valid licence under section 30B;';"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/34/eng@> .
