<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/34/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 53 the following section: \"Power to issue guidelines, etc. 53A. The Central Bank or the Minister may, from time to time, issue such guidelines, circulars or notes as the Central Bank or the Minister may deem expedient or necessary for carrying into effect the objects of this Act.\". Substitution of section 56"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/34/eng@> .
